  "description": "An evidence-graded dataset of Chicago house music, 1977-1995: 18 venues, 115 artists, 16 labels, 46 recordings (45 Discogs-verified), 156 network relationships, and a 368-claim evidence register in which every claim carries a CTL grade (Verified 154 / Supported 116 / Provisional 50 / Disputed 28 / Unresolved 20). Photo manifest: 49 Wikimedia Commons candidates, all UNVERIFIED \u2014 not cleared for use. Venue coordinates are blank by design; none are asserted.",
  "keywords": [
    "Chicago house music",
    "Frankie Knuckles",
    "Warehouse club",
    "Trax Records",
    "Black music history",
    "evidence-graded dataset",
    "knowledge graph"
  ],
